• Terms and Conditions (Terms of Sale): Clearly outline pricing, recurring billing or subscription terms, payment methods, delivery timelines, and cancellation rules.
• Refund and Return Policy: Make your return, exchange, and refund rules clear and conspicuous right on or near the order/checkout area so customers see them before buying.
• Privacy Policy: Disclose what personal data (names, emails, payment info) you collect, how you use it, and how users can opt out or manage their data (complying with laws like GDPR or CCPA).
• Disclaimers: Include relevant legal disclaimers based on your niche—such as earnings disclaimers for business coaching, health/medical disclaimers for wellness products, or affiliate disclosure statements if you earn a commission on recommended products.
• Explicit Consent at Checkout: Require customers to actively check a box or click an agreement button stating they accept your terms and privacy policy before the transaction goes through